            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "size": 1868,
            "text": "{\"sha\":\"e3327a0d0d127aa0c8e690fce48e292caf28b86f\",\"parents\":[\"dab077fe149ee1d1776fdbf8638e1c4d6d5dc8ee\"],\"message\":\"feat: add a scripted agent on the platform's model double for the SDK end-to-end walk (#13)\\n\\n* feat: add a scripted agent on the platform's model double for the SDK end-to-end walk\\n\\nSame tools, MCP opt-in and instructions as agents/agent.yaml, on\\nintrospection/scripted-llm, selected per task with agent_name.\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\\n\\n* fix: the scripted agent's thinking level is one the validator accepts\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\\n\\n---------\",\"author\":{\"name\":\"Julian\",\"email\":\"brightsparc@gmail.com\",\"date\":\"2026-10-23T11:10:37-07:00\"},\"committer\":{\"name\":\"GitHub\",\"email\":null,\"date\":\"2026-10-23T11:10:37-07:00\"},\"files\":[{\"filename\":\"agents/scripted.yaml\",\"status\":\"added\",\"additions\":25,\"deletions\":0,\"changes\":25}],\"patch\":\"diff --git a/agents/scripted.yaml b/agents/scripted.yaml\\nnew file mode 100644\\nindex 0000000..d690804\\n--- /dev/null\\n+++ b/agents/scripted.yaml\\n@@ -0,0 +1,25 @@\\n+# The same agent on the platform's scripted model double, so a run is\\n+# deterministic and costs nothing: each prompt carries a <<SCRIPT {...}>>\\n+# directive naming what a real model does on the instruction (introspection-cloud\\n+# docs/design/sdk-end-to-end-walk.md §2). Selected per task with agent_name.\\n+name: scripted\\n+description: Calls the hello MCP for the Harbor task, on the scripted model double\\n+ai:\\n+  model: introspection/scripted-llm\\n+  thinking_level: low\\n+tools:\\n+  - read\\n+  - bash\\n+  - write\\n+mcp:\\n+  mode: tools\\n+  servers:\\n+    hello-mcp:\\n+      include:\\n+        - echo\\n+skills: []\\n+subagents: []\\n+system_instructions:\\n+  mode: append\\n+  content: |\\n+    Use the declared hello MCP whenever the task asks you to echo a message.\\n\"}"
          },
